"Failed to initialize audio output: %s (audio disabled; video continues)\n"
msgstr "初始化音频输出失败：%s（已禁用音频，视频继续）\n"

#: src/app/Application.cpp:110
msgid ""
"Audio recording requires an audio stream. Use --no-audio-playback to record "
"without a sound device, or --no-audio to record video only."
msgstr ""
"录音需要启用音频流。没有声音设备时，可用 --no-audio-playback 只录制、不播放；"
"或用 --no-audio 只录视频。"

