#: tools/audio_decode_probe.cpp:189
msgid ""
"Input records are a 16-bit big-endian length followed by a UDP datagram, as "
"saved by rr_keepalive_probe --audio-out. Only RTP payload type 101 is "
"decoded, using 480 samples per channel per frame. Output is interleaved 16-"
"bit PCM. Numeric limits protect WAV fields; they do not guarantee codec "
"support. --help does not read or write files."
msgstr ""
"输入格式与 rr_keepalive_probe --audio-out 保存的文件一致：每条记录先写入 16 "
"位大端长度，再写入 UDP 数据报。工具只解码 RTP 载荷类型 101，每帧每声道按 480 "
"个采样处理，输出为交织的 16 位 PCM。参数上限用于防止 WAV 字段溢出，不代表后端"
"支持所有这些配置。--help 不读取或写入文件。"

