#: tools/hid_probe.cpp:186
msgid ""
"Queries and actions run in command-line order. --tap defaults to the center; "
"otherwise provide both X and Y.\n"
"For a center tap on a specific device, put UDID before --tap, or use --tap "
"-- UDID.\n"
"Without actions or queries, show help. --no-stream alone opens the HID "
"service without sending input.\n"
"The auxiliary video requests a 20-second RTCP idle timeout and sends no RR; "
"it may stop during a long test.\n"
"Exit closes the local receiver without calling stopAll, which would stop "
"other media sessions on the device.\n"
"A successful send does not confirm input took effect. No --probe-reply "
"response does not prove input failed.\n"
"--dry-run checks arguments and prints the plan without connecting to a "
"device."
msgstr ""
"查询和动作按参数出现的顺序执行。--tap 不带坐标时点击中心；带坐标时请同时提供 "
"X 和 Y。\n"
"指定设备并点击中心时，请把 UDID 放在 --tap 前，或使用 --tap -- UDID。\n"
"没有动作或查询时显示帮助。单独使用 --no-stream 只连接 HID 服务，不发送输"
"入。\n"
"辅助视频流请求 20 秒 RTCP 空闲超时，不发送 RR；测试时间较长时，流可能停止。\n"
"退出时关闭本地接收端，不调用 stopAll；该调用会停止设备上的其他媒体会话。\n"
"发送成功不能确认输入已生效；--probe-reply 没有收到回复，也不能证明输入失"
"败。\n"
