#, c-format
msgid ""
"--drop-at-packet(%d) must be 0 or at least 200 to avoid dropping part of the "
"startup IDR\n"
msgstr "--drop-at-packet(%d) 必须为 0 或至少 200，以免丢弃启动 IDR 的分片\n"

#: tools/stall_probe.cpp:124
#, c-format
msgid ""
"--fail-every-keyframe(%d) must be 0 or at least 4 to test fallback after "
"three restarts\n"
msgstr ""
"--fail-every-keyframe(%d) 必须为 0 或至少 4，才能检查三次重建后的降级行为\n"

#: tools/stall_probe.cpp:160
#, c-format
msgid "Failed to start video stream: %s\n"
msgstr "无法启动视频流：%s\n"

#: tools/stall_probe.cpp:165
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Test: fail the next %d keyframes including startup; no packet loss or "
"silence restart; observe fallback and recovery\n"
msgstr ""
"测试配置：让包括启动帧在内的后续 %d 个关键帧解码失败；不丢包，关闭包静默重"
"建，观察降级与恢复\n"

#: tools/stall_probe.cpp:170
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Test: drop video packet %d, ignore video after packet %d, suppress PLI and "
"disable silence restart; keyframe wait limit %d ms\n"
msgstr ""
"测试配置：丢弃第 %d 个视频包，第 %d 个之后忽略视频，禁止 PLI 并关闭包静默重"
"建；等待关键帧的上限为 %d ms\n"

#: tools/stall_probe.cpp:175
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Test: drop packet %d, fail %d recovery keyframes, continue PLI; restart "
"deadline %d ms\n"
msgstr ""
"测试配置：丢弃第 %d 个视频包，让 %d 个恢复关键帧解码失败并持续发送 PLI；重建"
"期限为 %d ms\n"

#: tools/stall_probe.cpp:180
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Test: drop packet %d, disable silence restart, wait up to %d ms for "
"recovery; fail %d recovery keyframes and suppress PLI after the first "
"failure\n"
msgstr ""
"测试配置：丢弃第 %d 个视频包，关闭包静默重建，最多等待 %d ms 恢复；让 %d 个恢"
"复关键帧解码失败，并在首次失败后禁止 PLI\n"

