"stall restarts=%llu total restarts=%llu\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"统计：包数=%llu（视频=%llu SR=%llu）序号缺口=%llu PLI=%llu（抑制=%llu）"
"AU=%llu 丢弃=%llu 已解码=%llu 注入失败=%llu 等待超时重建=%llu 总重建=%llu\n"

